o the 2000 U.S. standard population\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Statistical software was used to account for the complex sampling design of the survey.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Pairwise comparisons were performed to calculate t statistics, and differences were considered significant at p<0.05.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"When multiple comparisons were made, the Bonferroni adjustment was used (p<0.05 / number of comparisons).\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}